          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடலோரம் — kaṭalōram — \"the coast; the seaside\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடலோரக் கிராமங்களில் மீனவர்கள் வாழ்கிறார்கள். kaṭalōrak kirāmaṅkaḷil mīṉavarkaḷ vāḻkiṟārkaḷ. Fishermen live in the coastal villages."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "As a modifier it drops -ம்: கடலோரக் கிராமம், a coastal village."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடலோரம் (kaṭalōram) is built from கடல், \"the sea\" (DEDR 1118), and ஓரம், \"an edge, a border\" (DEDR 1060)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
